'''Elm Park''' is an electoral ward in the [[London Borough of Havering]]. The ward has existed since the creation of the borough on 1 April 1965 and was first used in the [[1964 London local elections|1964 elections]]. It returns councillors to [[Havering London Borough Council]].

==List of councillors==
The ward has been represented by three councillors since the first election.<ref name="Election Centre">{{cite web |last1=Rallings |first1=Colin |last2=Thrasher |first2=Michael |title=London Borough of Havering Election Results 1964-2010 |url=https://www.electionscentre.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Havering-1964-2010.pdf |website=The Elections Centre |access-date=15 March 2025}}</ref><ref name="1964 Havering">{{cite web |title=1964 London Borough of Havering local election results |url=https://www.havering.gov.uk/downloads/file/4291/1964-london-borough-of-havering-local-election-results |website=Havering Council |access-date=15 March 2025}}</ref>
